Committed as `820fff1`. Here's what changed:

**FIX 1 ΓÇö `components/BlogList.tsx`**
- `readTime` on `BlogPost` interface: `number` ΓåÆ `number | undefined`
- `PostMeta` component: all three parts (date, separator, "N min read") are now conditional ΓÇö only rendered when the relevant data is present. No more bare "┬╖ min read".

**FIX 2 ΓÇö `components/BlogList.tsx`**
- Card grid container: added `alignItems: 'start'` so cards without artwork don't stretch to match their row-mate.
- Category chip in both the lead post and grid cards: wrapped in `{post.category && (...)}` ΓÇö no empty pill when category is absent.

**FIX 3 ΓÇö `app/globals.css`**
- `.blog-lead .lead-art`: removed `height: 100%`, added `align-self: center`. The 16:9 aspect ratio now governs the box height, eliminating the right-edge crop.
